You may have to pay income and capital gains tax on all income and gains you get from your investment. The precise tax consequences of any investment will depend on your personal circumstances and tax laws. If you're in any doubt as to your tax position, we recommend you talk to a professional tax adviser. Information on taxation is based on our understanding of current UK legislation and practice. However, tax rules may change in the future.
